# rwai-bench content-bearing category fragment (api-orchestration, PROJ-621):
# the artifact set orchestrates an external API workflow — its workday ticks
# additionally project the admitted Arazzo description (examples/
# arazzo-api-orchestration.ttl) into dispatch contracts executed
# EXTERNAL_MACHINE_DISPATCH through the broker loopback adapter.
# Appended to the first domain fragment by generate::write_set, exactly like
# the interruption/planning fragments (PROJ-609).
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/rwai#> .

ex:{{SUBJECT}} ex:orchestratesApi ex:{{TARGET}} ;
  ex:orchestrationDialect "arazzo" .
